rs/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-09T06:44:55Z","updated_at":"2026-06-09T06:44:55Z","body":"The issue seems to be `!drop_mode_flags` in the `Tree::get_drop_section_at_position`, it's checking flags of the drop target, and scene tree only set flags after calling `get_drop_section_at_position` so it's always zero. So it's probably an issue with `SceneTreeEditor` not a base tree.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4656875326/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4658535163","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120098#issuecomment-4658535163","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120098","id":4658535163,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFaua-w","user":{"login":"vaner-org","id":9658355,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NTgzNTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9658355?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org","html_url":"https://github.com/vaner-org","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-09T09:48:06Z","updated_at":"2026-06-09T09:48:06Z","body":"Thank you for catching this @bruvzg.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4658535163/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6275643093","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120098#issuecomment-6275643093","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120098","id":6275643093,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABdg621Q","user":{"login":"dongohu","id":11067356,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDY3MzU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11067356?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dongohu","html_url":"https://github.com/dongohu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dongohu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dongohu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dongohu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dongohu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dongohu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dongohu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dongohu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dongohu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dongohu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-19T19:36:41Z","updated_at":"2026-10-19T19:39:57Z","body":"There's a strange behavior with the drag & drop (which happens at least up to 4.7.2 stable) where the target set when releasing the file (be it a .tscn or a .gd file)  is returning the wrong target.\n\nFrom what I could test, there's a few problems, but the results are actually quite 100% reproducible with really precise defined rules.\n\nFirst, you can only seem to be able to drag and drop .tscn (and .gd script) files from the FileSystem into the Scene Dock if the targeted node already have a children and the children is visible in the dock (extended). If there's no children, the mouse icon display as if it's not possible to drop the scene file into the dock. A work around this bug is to add a temporary children (any node work) via a right click and then \"Add Child Node\".\n\nBut, then comes another problem that is which file is actually targeted by the drop. To put it in simple terms, the actual target of the drop is always 2 nodes **_visually_** under the one you have dropped the file onto visually in the scene dock's hierarchy. For .tscn file, it it will appear as a brother (same parent) as the file 2 nodes under the one you have dropped on. (If there are collapsed nodes, it will skip the children hidden nodes under the parent, but if it's an extended parents, it will take into consideration the children displayed in the dock.)\n\nfor example:\n(TREE)\n-(A)\n--(B)\n---(C)\n--(D)\n-(E)\n\nSo A and E are children of the Tree node.\nB and D are children of A.\nC is a children of B.\n\n• (D) and (E) cannot get any file .tscn or .gd files dropped directly onto them from the FileSystem as they don't have any children.\n(For some reason, (C) seem to be okay~ish to get something dropped onto it. This might have something to do with the rule of 2-below previously mentioned like only node with 2 layers of parents above them can have something dropped without having actual children themselves.)\n• If you drop a .gd file onto (B), it will be applied to (D) instead which is 2 nodes under (visually) in the hierarchy.\n• If you drop a .tscn file onto (A), it will become a children of (C) which is 2 nodes under (visually).\n• If you drop a .tscn file onto (C), it will become a children of (E) which is 2 nodes under (visually).\n\nIf you collapse (B) and visually ends up with this:\n(TREE)\n-(A)\n--(B)\n--(D)\n-(E)\n\nIf you drag and drop a .tscn file onto (A), it will become a children of (D) as (C) is hidden under the collapsed (B).\n\nIt's actually possible to visualize which file is \"selected\" by the drag and drop in the Scene Dock by holding the .tscn or .gd file over any scene's node for a few sec. The actual \"targeted\" node's name will turn blue.\n\nAs such, it's possible to work around this major editor's breaking bug by adding temporary nodes as children and taking into account the rule of 2-below selection. (But, let's be honest, that's really not a good thing.)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6275643093/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6286765817","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120098#issuecomment-6286765817","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120098","id":6286765817,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABdrhu-Q","user":{"login":"vaner-org","id":9658355,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2NTgzNTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9658355?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org","html_url":"https://github.com/vaner-org","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-20T08:26:31Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T08:26:41Z","body":"@dongohu I cannot reproduce what you're describing on latest build from the 4.7 or master branches.\nPlease make a new issue with an MRP and a video showing it in action.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6286765817/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]